id: dave/node
title: "dave node"
kind: mental-model-node
status: active
updated: 2026-09-09

purpose: >
  Hold Dave's public mental models: small, questions-first records of what
  a thing is and why it matters from Dave's perspective, projected as pages
  under dave/<slug>/ so a person or a Yawn.bot can carry the same model.

principal_ref: principal:dave
template_ref: templates/mental-model.yawn
validator_ref: scripts/validate-mental-models.mjs

holds:
  - number-sense
  - prenumerical-thinking

receives:
  - lived situations where Dave needs a shared model with a person or a bot
  - the mental-model template and its question keys

produces:
  - inspectable why-first pages
  - a record of assumptions and what reality would have to show
  - a shape a Yawn.bot can embody in its communication style

self_scan: >
  npm run validate walks this node: every entry in holds must have a
  dave/<slug>/model.yawn and a dave/<slug>/index.html that mirrors the record's
  question order, uses only global site tokens, and declares no new dependency.

questions:
  - what is this, and why does it matter from Dave's perspective
  - which mental model is missing next
